                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mt-4">
                                        <div class="ap-avatar d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="background: var(--ap-surface-alt); color: var(--ap-blue); font-weight: 700;">AM</div>
                                        <div>
                                            <div class="fw-semibold">Aarav Mehta</div>
                                            <div class="role">B.Tech, Computer Science</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-3 pt-3" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--ap-line);">
                                        <span class="fw-semibold" style="font-size: .85rem;">Capgemini</span>
                                        <span class="ap-package-chip">7.2 LPA</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-4 ap-reveal">
                                <div class="ap-quote-card">
                                    <span class="ap-quote-mark">&ldquo;</span>
                                    <p style="color: var(--ap-text-soft); font-size: .94rem;">Corporate relations connected me directly with the hiring manager during the pre-placement talk.</p>
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mt-4">
                                        <div class="ap-avatar d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="background: var(--ap-surface-alt); color: var(--ap-blue); font-weight: 700;">SR</div>
                                        <div>
                                            <div class="fw-semibold">Sneha Rao</div>
                                            <div class="role">MBA, Marketing</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-3 pt-3" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--ap-line);">
                                        <span class="fw-semibold" style="font-size: .85rem;">IndiaMART</span>
                                        <span class="ap-package-chip">9.5 LPA</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-4 ap-reveal">
                                <div class="ap-quote-card">
                                    <span class="ap-quote-mark">&ldquo;</span>
                                    <p style="color: var(--ap-text-soft); font-size: .94rem;">The resume clinic rewrote how I presented my internship projects — it made all the difference.</p>
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mt-4">
                                        <div class="ap-avatar d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="background: var(--ap-surface-alt); color: var(--ap-blue); font-weight: 700;">KS</div>
                                        <div>
                                            <div class="fw-semibold">Kunal Shah</div>
                                            <div class="role">B.Tech, Mechanical</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-3 pt-3" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--ap-line);">
                                        <span class="fw-semibold" style="font-size: .85rem;">Yokohama Tyres</span>
                                        <span class="ap-package-chip">6.8 LPA</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>


                <section class="ap-section" style="background: var(--ap-surface-alt);">
                    <div class="container">
                        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end mb-5 ap-reveal">
                            <div>
                                <span class="ap-eyebrow">Recruiters</span>
